  "decision_conditions": [
    "Condition : 1 - \r\n?The London Borough of Hounslow as the Local Planning Authority hereby certify that on18 December 2007 the change of use of from A3 (Restaurant) to A2 (Financial and Professional Services) at 160 High Street, Hounslow was lawful within the meaning of Sections 191 and 192 of the Town and Country Planning Act 1990 for the following reason:\r\nThe development falls within the provisions of the Use Classes Order of the General Permitted Development, (Amendment), Order, 2005 because Class A3, (Restaurants) are permitted to change to Class A2 (Financial and Professional Services) without the need for a Planning Application for a material change of use.\r\n"
